{"id":"seed-em-dipol-far","title":"Medan listrik dipol pada jarak jauh (r ≫ d)","field":"Elektrodinamika","tags":["dipol","listrik","far field","limit","medan","potensial","ekspansi"],
"problem":"Dua muatan +q dan −q terpisah d; tentukan V dan E di titik (r, θ) dengan r ≫ d.",
"conditions":["r ≫ d","muatan titik pada ±d/2 sepanjang sumbu z","ruang hampa","simetri azimut"],
"result":"$$\\mathbf E(r,\\theta)=\\frac{p}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0 r^3}\\left(2\\cos\\theta\\,\\hat{\\mathbf r}+\\sin\\theta\\,\\hat{\\boldsymbol\\theta}\\right),\\quad p=qd$$",
"steps":[
{"t":"Potensial eksak dua muatan","m":"$$V=\\frac{q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0}\\left(\\frac1{r_+}-\\frac1{r_-}\\right),\\quad r_\\pm^2=r^2+\\frac{d^2}{4}\\mp rd\\cos\\theta$$","why":"Superposisi potensial skalar; r± diperoleh dari hukum kosinus."},
{"t":"Ekspansi binomial","m":"$$\\frac1{r_\\pm}=\\frac1r\\left(1\\mp\\frac dr\\cos\\theta+\\frac{d^2}{4r^2}\\right)^{-1/2}\\approx\\frac1r\\left(1\\pm\\frac d{2r}\\cos\\theta\\right)$$","why":"$(1+x)^{-1/2}\\approx 1-x/2$ sah bila $|x|\\ll1$, yaitu r ≫ d; suku $\\mathcal O(d^2/r^2)$ dibuang."},
{"t":"Potensial dipol","m":"$$V\\approx\\frac{1}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0}\\frac{qd\\cos\\theta}{r^2}=\\frac1{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0}\\frac{\\mathbf p\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf r}}{r^2}$$","why":"Suku orde 1/r saling meniadakan karena muatan total nol."},
{"t":"Gradien potensial","m":"$$E_r=-\\partial_rV=\\frac{2p\\cos\\theta}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^3},\\quad E_\\theta=-\\frac1r\\partial_\\theta V=\\frac{p\\sin\\theta}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^3}$$","why":"$\\mathbf E=-\\nabla V$ dalam koordinat bola; $E_\\phi=0$ karena V tak bergantung φ."}],
"relations":[{"q":"Jarak r","rel":"$E\\propto r^{-3}$, meluruh lebih cepat daripada monopol ($r^{-2}$)"},{"q":"Torsi pada medan luar","rel":"$\\boldsymbol\\tau=\\mathbf p\\times\\mathbf E_{ext}$"},{"q":"Energi potensial","rel":"$U=-\\mathbf p\\cdot\\mathbf E_{ext}$"}],
"sources":[{"t":"Griffiths, Introduction to Electrodynamics, §3.4"},{"t":"Jackson, Classical Electrodynamics (3rd ed.), Bab 4"}],"status":"seed"},
{"id":"seed-stat-fermi-cv","title":"Kapasitas kalor gas Fermi ideal pada T ≪ T_F","field":"Fisika Statistik","tags":["fermi","gas","kapasitas kalor","sommerfeld","temperatur rendah","limit","elektron"],
"problem":"Tentukan $C_V$ gas Fermi ideal 3D (spin ½) untuk $k_BT\\ll\\varepsilon_F$.",
"conditions":["$k_BT\\ll\\varepsilon_F$","gas Fermi ideal 3D","spin ½, $g(\\varepsilon)\\propto\\varepsilon^{1/2}$","N tetap"],
"result":"$$C_V=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}Nk_B\\frac{T}{T_F}=\\frac{\\pi^2}{3}k_B^2\\,g(\\varepsilon_F)\\,T$$",
"steps":[
{"t":"Besaran dasar","m":"$$N=\\int_0^\\infty g f\\,d\\varepsilon,\\quad U=\\int_0^\\infty \\varepsilon g f\\,d\\varepsilon,\\quad g=\\frac{3N}{2\\varepsilon_F^{3/2}}\\varepsilon^{1/2}$$","why":"Rapat keadaan 3D nonrelativistik dinormalisasi agar $N(T=0)=N$."},
{"t":"Ekspansi Sommerfeld","m":"$$\\int_0^\\infty H f\\,d\\varepsilon=\\int_0^\\mu H\\,d\\varepsilon+\\frac{\\pi^2}{6}(k_BT)^2H'(\\mu)+\\mathcal O(T^4)$$","why":"$-\\partial f/\\partial\\varepsilon$ runcing di sekitar μ sehingga H dapat dideret Taylor di μ; sah bila $k_BT\\ll\\mu$."},
{"t":"Potensial kimia dan energi dalam","m":"$$\\mu=\\varepsilon_F\\left[1-\\frac{\\pi^2}{12}\\Big(\\frac{k_BT}{\\varepsilon_F}\\Big)^2\\right],\\quad U=\\frac35N\\varepsilon_F\\left[1+\\frac{5\\pi^2}{12}\\Big(\\frac{k_BT}{\\varepsilon_F}\\Big)^2\\right]$$","why":"μ ditentukan dari syarat N tetap, lalu disubstitusi ke U."},
{"t":"Turunan terhadap T","m":"$$C_V=\\Big(\\frac{\\partial U}{\\partial T}\\Big)_{V,N}=\\frac{\\pi^2}{2}Nk_B\\frac{T}{T_F}$$","why":"Linear dalam T: hanya fermion dalam lapisan ~$k_BT$ di sekitar $\\varepsilon_F$ dapat tereksitasi (asas larangan Pauli)."}],
"relations":[{"q":"Temperatur","rel":"$C_V\\propto T$ (klasik: konstan $\\tfrac32Nk_B$)"},{"q":"Rapat keadaan","rel":"$C_V=\\tfrac{\\pi^2}{3}k_B^2g(\\varepsilon_F)T$"}],
"sources":[{"t":"Ashcroft & Mermin, Solid State Physics, Bab 2"},{"t":"Pathria & Beale, Statistical Mechanics, §8.1"}],"status":"seed"}
]
